<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">LOM -SUKWA BIBLE TRANSLATION PROJECT 14 SEPTEMBER 2022</book>
  <para style="h">ABA LOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aba Lom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aba Loma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lom</para>
  <para style="mt1">ABA LOMA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Aba Loma</para>
  <para style="imt">Ukwanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibuku lya ba Loma likasimbiwa nu mutumiwa u Pabuli mufyinja fya pakati pa fifite folo mupaka mu fifite eyiti bo u Yesu Kilisitu apapiwa. U Pabuli akaba akali pakubuka mu Loma akatuma ukalata uwa kulongosya aba Kilisitu aba mu Loma na ba Yuda sona nabo te ba Yuda. U Pabuli akaba akali pakwendela ku Loma po akatuma u kalata ku ba Kilisitu mu Loma, naku ba Yuda sona nakubo te ba Yuda. Akasimba ukalata ukufuma makaya aka Kolifi ko akikalagha pakabalilo kala kala. U Pabuli akasimba ukuti ichisu chosi chisubile sona nukumwifwila u Yesu Kilisitu (16.26). Ibuku lya ba Loma libuku lya kulondiwa ku ba Kilisitu kosi na kosi namu tubalilo tosi chifukwa cha mo u Pabuli akalongosolela nisya bupoki bo tuli nabo ukwendela mwa Kilisitu Yesu. U Pabuli akulumikisya sona Amasyu Amisa agha Yesu Kilisitu mwi buku ilya kale. Abamanyili abingi bakaghesya ngani mufimo ifyakulondiwa mwi buku ili mu vesi (1.16) lyo likuti, “Pakuti nde ni soni pakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa, chifukwa gho maka gha Chala gho ghakubapoka abandu bosi bo bakubusubila, ukwandila na ba Yuda panyuma pake na bandu abapanja” Pakachigaba akabwandilo mwi buku lya ba Loma (1.12) kakulingannya ngani nisya bumanyi sona mu chigaba icha bubili (13.15) lili ni nyinong’ono isya kulongosya ubumi bwa chikilisitu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ifya mukati</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Ukwanda ni fundo1.1-17.</para>
  <para style="io2">2. Ukulondiwa kwa bupoki 1.18-3.20.</para>
  <para style="io2">3. Isila ya Chala iya bupoki 3.21-4.25.</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ubumi ubupya mwa Kilisitu 5.1-8.39.</para>
  <para style="io2">5. Aba Izilayeli mulubatiko lwa Chala 9.1-11.36.</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Ingalo ya Bakilisitu 12.1-15.13.</para>
  <para style="io2">7. Ubumalilo nu kulamuka 15.14-16.27.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">U Balanabasi nu Sabuli bakusaliwa nu kutumiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Muchipanga cha mukaya ka Andiyokiya mukaba abasololi na bamanyisi, u Balanabasi nu Simiyoni yo bakati mufitu, u Lusiyasi uwa mu Keleni, u Manayi yo akakulilagha poka nu malafyale u Helodi, nu Sabuli. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Bo bali pakwiputa kwa Malafyale nukutusya pakulya, u Mbepo Mwikemo akababusya akati, “Musabulile u Balanabasi nu Sabuli ukuti babombe imbombo yo ngabitisya.<verse eid="ROM 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Po bo batusya pakulya nukwiputa, bakabika inyobe pa pabo nukubatuma.<verse eid="ROM 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muchisu cha Sayipulasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />Bo batumiwa nu Mbepo Mwikemo u Balanabasi nu Sabuli bakabuka mukaya ka Selebukiya nukuloboka nu bwato pakubuka pa kasungo ka Sayipulasi. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Bo bafika mu Salami, bakalumbilila amasyu gha Chala mu nyumba sya kwiputilamo isya ba Yuda. Bakaba poka nu Yohani uwa kubafwa.<verse eid="ROM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Bo babukilila mosi mu kasungo bakafikila ku Pafosi, bakamwagha umundu uwa mayele, umu Yuda umusololi wabumyasi, ilita lyake akaba we Bala Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />yo akaba nu Saligiya Pabuli, yo akaba mundu wa mahala, weyo akamwitisya u Balanabasi nu Sabuli ukuti bateghelesye Isyu lya Chala. <verse eid="ROM 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Loli Elimasi uwa mayele (pakuti ilita lyake likang’anamula bububu) akabasusya nu kughesya pakumunyosya umulaghili wa chisu ukuti atakasubile. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Po u Sabuli yo bakati Pabuli, akisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo, akamulolelesya uwa mayele yula <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />nukuti, “We mwana wa Satana! We mulughu wa chindu chosi cho chisa, sona wiswile nu bumyasi nu kusimbula, imba utakuleka pakunyongannya isila inyisa isya Malafyale? <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Pololi, tesya inyobe ya Malafyale yili pa uwe, po ukwisa pakuba mufwa maso nukupotwa pa kutesya isuba pakabalilo akapala.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:11">Papapo na papapo ukabefu ni chisi fikamuwila, akapulumbagha pakulonda yumo uwa kuti amukole inyobe. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Bo umulindili wa chisu atesya syo sikabombiwagha akasubila, pakuti akaswigha ni chimanyisyo cha Malafyale.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mu kaya aka Andiyokiya mu Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Po u Pabuli na banine bakenda pa bwato ukufuma mu Pafosi nukubuka ku Peliga mu chisu cha Pamufiliya, ko u Yohani akabaleka nu kunyokela ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Loli bakenda ukufuma ku Peliga ukufika ku Andiyokiya uwa mu Pisidiya. Po bakingila mu nyumba ya kwiputilamo pisiku lya kutusya nu kwikala pasi. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Bo babelenga mumabuku gha Ndaghilo sya Mozesi nagha basololi, abalongosi ba nyumba yakwiputilamo bakabatumila amasyu aghakuti, “Bakamu, pala muli na masyu aghakubabusya abandu aba, yugha.”<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Po u Pabuli akimilila, akabatebesya ichongo ni nyobe yake akati, “Banalume ba mu Izilayeli, namwe mukumoghopa u Chala, teghelesya. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Ukf1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Ukf12.51</ref>.</char></note>U Chala uwa bandu aba mu Izilayeli abanyenya bitu, akabakwesya abandu bala bo bagheni mu chisu cha Ijiputi, po akabatisya mu chisu cha Ijiputi namaka ghake ghosi, <verse eid="ROM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Ukb14.34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Ukk1.31</ref>. </char></note>pakuti akayimba nabo ifinja fote mungolongo. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Ukk7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Yos14.1</ref>.</char></note>Akakomannya ifikolo fya bandu seveni mu Kenani, nukubapa ichisu chabo ukuti bapyane pakuba chabo. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Abl2.16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam3.20</ref>.</char></note>Fyosi fififi fikasenya ifinja folo handeledi fifite. Panyuma pasisi akabapa abalongi ukufika pakabalilo ka musololi u Samuyeli. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam8.5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10.21</ref>.</char></note> Po abandu bakasuma u malafyale, u Chala akabapa u Sabuli umwana wa Kishi, umundu waluko lwa Benjamini, pa finja fote. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Mas89.20</ref>.</char></note>Bo amutisyapo u Sabuli, akabasalila u Devedi ukuti abe we malafyale wabo, yo akasimikisya ukuti, ‘Namwagha u Devedi umwana wa Yese, umundu wa pamoyo wangu, yo ayukubomba ubwighane bwangu bosi.’ <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Akaba we Yesu, uwaluko lwa Devedi, yo u Chala akamubika pakuba Mupoki wa Izilayeli ukuyana nipangano lyake. <verse eid="ROM 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Miko1.4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk3.3</ref>.</char></note> Bo akali atisile umwene, u Yohani akalumbilila ulosyo lwa lupinduko ku bandu bosi aba mu Izilayeli. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yoh1.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat3.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Miko1.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Yoh1.27</ref>.</char></note>Bo u Yohani ali papipi pakumalisya imbombo yake, akabalalusya abandu bala akati, ‘Imba mukwinong’ona ukuti une ne wenu? Une tenene yo mukumulindila. Loli tesya, umwene akwisa panyuma pa pangu. Ndabaghile napo papala pakusatula utukungilo twa sapato syake.’<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />“Mwee bakamu bangu ba Izilayeli, abaluko lwa Abulahamu namwe mukumoghopa u Chala, isyu lya bupoki lya tumiwa ku utwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Pakuti bo bakwikala mu Yelusalemu na balongosi babo, bo batakamumanya u Yesu, pamo amasyu gha basololi gho bakabelengagha isiku lyosi ilya kutusya, bakakwanilisya syosi sisisi pakumughogha. <verse eid="ROM 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22">Mat27.22</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23">23</ref>.</char></note>Napo batakamwagha ni nongwa nayimo iyakumughoghela, loli bakamusuma u Pilati ukuti u Yesu aghoghiwe.<verse eid="ROM 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:52-56">Luk23.52-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:8-42">Yoh19.8-42</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo bamala syosi syo amasimbo ghakayugha nisya yuyo, bakamwisya pambinjika nukumubika mwipumba. <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />Loli u Chala akamususya kubufwe, <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Imbo1.3</ref>.</char></note>po amasiku amingi akababonekela bo bakenda nawe ukufuma mu Galileya ukubuka mu Yelusalemu, bo ipano bo bakamboni bake ku bandu. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Po tuli pakubabusya Amasyu Amisa gho u Chala akapangana na banyenya bitu, <verse eid="ROM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 1:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mas2.7</ref>.</char></note>ukuti akwanilisya ku twe bana bake pakumususya u Yesu kubufwe ukuyana namo mukasimbiliwa mwa masalimo uwabubili ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:33">“Uwe we Mwana wangu, ipano na kupapa.”<verse eid="ROM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 1:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Yis55.3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Loli pakuti akamususya kubufwe, ukuti atakanyokele sona pakubola. Ngati mo u Chala akayughila ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:34">‘Ngwisa pakubapa ulusayo ulwikemo ulwa bwanaloli, lo akapangana nu Devedi.’<verse eid="ROM 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 1:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Mas16.10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pololi akayugha sona mwa Masalimo uyungi ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:35">‘Utakitikisye ukuti u Mwikemo wako atesye ukubola.’<verse eid="ROM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 1:36" />Pakuti bo u Devedi abomba ukuyana namo u Chala akabatikila pakabalilo kake, akafwa nukusiliwa poka na banyenya bake, po umufimba wake ghukabola, <verse eid="ROM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 1:37" />loli yo u Chala akamususya kubufwe atakatesyapo ukobola. <verse eid="ROM 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 1:38" />Pololi bakamu bangu, musimanye ukuti mwa Yesu, momo mukufumusiwa ukuhobokeliwa kwa mbibi, <verse eid="ROM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 1:39" />ukwendela mumwake wesi yo akusubila akubwagha ubupoki bo wesi angayughiwa pakuba mwisa pakukonga indaghilo sya Moses. <verse eid="ROM 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ROM 1:40" />Muchebe ukuti syo abasololi bakayugha sitakabombiwe ku umwe. <verse eid="ROM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ROM 1:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb1.5</ref>.</char></note>‘Tesya, mwe balobesyo umwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:41">Muswighe nu kufwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:41">Pakuti ngubomba imbombo une mumasiku ghinyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 1:41">imbombo yo temukasubile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 1:41">napo pala yumo akubabusya.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ROM 1:42" />Bo u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakafumamo munyumba yakwiputilamo, abamanyili bakabasuma ukuti bise bababusye sona amasyu ghagha pisiku lya kutusya ilingi. <verse eid="ROM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ROM 1:43" />Bo abandu bafumapo palukomano lula, aba Yuda abingi na bakupindukila ku Chiyuda, bakamukonga u Pabuli nu Balanabasi, bakababusya nu kubakasya ukuti bendelele pakwikala ukuyana nichisa cha Chala.<verse eid="ROM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ROM 1:44" />Po pisiku lyakutusya ilingi, bakabungana bosi poka ngati kaya kosi pakwifwa isyu lya Chala. <verse eid="ROM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ROM 1:45" />Loli bo aba Yuda batesya ichilundilo cha bandu, bakisula nakabini, bakasusannya nasyo u Pabuli akayugha nu kumusamula ngani. <verse eid="ROM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ROM 1:46" />Po u Pabuli nu Balanabasi bakayugha nubukifu ukuti, “Chikaba chakulondiwa ukuti Isyu lya Chala liyughiwe tasi ku umwe. Loli pakuti mwaghakana, sona ukuti mukwinong’ona mutabaghile pakupokela ubumi bwa bwile na bwile, tesya, tukunyokela ku bapanja. <verse eid="ROM 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ROM 1:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Yis42.6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49.6</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Malafyale akatupa ilamulo lyakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 1:47">‘Nakubika uwe pakuba bwelu ku bapanja,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 1:47">ukuti abandu ba muchisu chosi bapokiwe.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ROM 1:48" />Bo abapanja bifwa sisisi, bakahoboka nu kupala Isyu lya Chala, po bosi bo bakabikiwa ku bumi bwa bwile na bwile bakasubila.<verse eid="ROM 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ROM 1:49" />Isyu lya Malafyale likasata muchisu chosi. <verse eid="ROM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ROM 1:50" />Loli aba Yuda bakabakakamisya abakolo abamanyikwe aba kwiputa u Chala, na basongo aba mukaya, bakanda pakubafwima u Pabuli nu Balanabasi nukubatisyamo mukaya kabo. <verse eid="ROM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ROM 1:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mat10.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1">Miko6.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk9.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10.11</ref>.</char></note>Loli abene bakabakung’undila ulufumbi ulwa mufinama fyabo, bakabuka mukaya ka Ikoniyamu. <verse eid="ROM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ROM 1:52" />Po abitiki aba mukaya aka Andiyokiya bakahoboka ngani nu kwisula nu Mbepo Mwikemo.<verse eid="ROM 1:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Ubulongi bwa Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 12:5-7">2 Sam12.5-7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:1-7">Mat7.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:7-9">Yoh8.7-9</ref>.</char>
    </note>Uwe, ute na pakulyeghelapo we ukulonga abanyako, pakuti bo ukulonga abanyako, ukwisusya wemwene pakuti we mulongi ukubomba ifindu fyoka fila fila. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Tusimenye ukuti u Chala akulongela mubwanaloli abandu bo bakubomba ifindu fififi. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Po uwe we mundu bubu, ukubalonga abanyako, loli ukubomba ifindu fila fila! Imba ukwinong’ona ukuti ukwisa pakubulyegha ubulongi bwa Chala? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:18">Yis30.18</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:25">Aba Lom3.25</ref>.</char></note> Imba uwe ukusula ichisa ichikulu icha Chala, ubufisalyoyo bwake, sona nu bwachimyeka? Imba utasimenye ukuti u Chala wa chisa pakuti akughesya pakukulongosya ukuti upinduke nukusileka imbibi syako? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Loli chifukwa cha bukafu bwa moyo wako, umusita kupinduka, ukwilundikila wemwene ubukali bwa Chala, pisiku lyo ubulongi bwake ubwanaloli bukwisa pakufumbuliwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Mas62.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat16.27</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Chala akwisa pakumupa umundu wesi umufwalo ukuyana ni mbombo syake. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ku bandu bosi bo bakwendelela pakubomba ubwisa, sona bakulonda ubughindikiwa, ulughindiko nu bumi, u Chala akwisa pakubapa ubumi bwa bwile na bwile <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 1:8">2 Tes1.8</ref>.</char></note>Loli bosi bo bakwiyighana bene nukukana ukwifwila ubwanaloli, loli nukubomba imbibi, u Chala akwisa pakubakalalila nukubafunda ngani. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Indamyo nu kutamiwa fikwisa pakubawila abandu bosi bo bakubomba imbibi, ukwandila na ba Yuda, po sona na bandu bapanja <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Loli u Chala akwisa pakubapa ubughindikiwa, ulughindiko nu mutende abandu bosi bo bakubomba inyisa, ukwandila na ba Yuda, po sona na bandu bapanja <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Ukk10.17</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Chala atakutesya icheni cha mundu pakulonga inongwa.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Abandu bosi banangite ukusita kumanya indaghilo, bakwisa pakusimila napo batasimeye indaghilo. Sona bosi bo banangite bo basimenye indaghilo, bakwisa pakulongiwa ukuyana ni ndaghilo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Pakuti te bo bakwifwa bubu indaghilo bo u Chala akubayugha ukuti bagholoke pamaso papake, loli bo bakubomba syo indaghilo sikuyugha, bobo u Chala akuyugha ukuti bagholoke pamaso pake. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Naloli, abapanja bate ni ndaghilo, loli bo bakubomba nu bundu bwabo ukuyana ni ndaghilo, palwabo bakulangisya ukuti bafimenye fyo babaghile pakufibomba, napo bate ni ndaghilo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Bakulangisya ingalo syabo ukuti syo ndaghilo syo sisimbiwe mumyoyo yabo. Umabyebye wabo akusimikisya ukuti isi syabwanaloli pakuti inyinong’ono syabo sikubasusya pamo ukubimila. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Ukuyana na Masyu Amisa gho ngulumbilila, umu momo kukwisa pakubela, u Chala akwisa pakulonga inyinong’ono isyakubusyefu mwilita lya Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aba Yuda ni ndaghilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Loli uwe, pala ukwiyitisya wemwene ukuti we mu Yuda, pala ukusubila indaghilo, sona nukwitufikisya mwa Chala, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />pala usimenye syo u Chala akulonda ukuti ubombe, sona umenye pakusala cho chisa chifukwa ukamanyisiwa mu ndaghilo, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />sona pala naloli wamanya ukuti uwe we mulongosi wa bafwamaso, we nyale ya bandu bo bali muchisi, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />we mulongosi wa bandu abalunganu, sona we mumanyisi wa bana bapala chifukwa uli nindaghilo ukughaghamo amahala nu bwanaloli bosi. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Uwe we kumanyisya abandu abangi, po choni cho utakwimanyisya wemwene? Uwe ukulumbilila ukuti, “Utakibaghe” po imba choni cho uwe ukwiba? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Ukuyugha ukuti, “Utakalowaghe” po imba choni cho uwe ukulowa? Uwe we ufibengite ififwani, po imba choni cho ukwibapo ifya munyumba ya kwiputilamo ififwani? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Uwe we kwitufikisya mu ndaghilo sya Chala, imba choni cho ukumukosya isoni u Chala pakunangannya indaghilo? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:20">Ezk36.20</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 36:23">23</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti, “Ilita lya Chala likusamuliwa mu bapanja chifukwa cha umwe.” <verse eid="ROM 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Pala ukukonga indaghilo, ukusilimuliwa kwako kwisa, loli pala utakukonga indaghilo ukusilimuliwa kwako kwa bubu. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Pala umundu yo atasilimuliwe akwifwila syo indaghilo sikuyugha, imba pa maso gha Chala atangaba ngati mundu uwakusilimuliwa, napo atasilimuliwe? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Po umundu yo atasilimuliwe, yo akukonga indaghilo akwisa pakukulonga uwe we usilimuliwe, sona uwe uli ni ndaghilo syo sisimbiwe, loli ukunangannya indaghilo. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Umu Yuda umwenecho te we yo angaboneka ngati mu Yuda pamaso pa bandu, sona ukusilimuliwa ukwabwanaloli, te ko kukubombiwa pamubili na pamaso pa bandu. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:4">1 Pit3.4</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:11">Kols2.11</ref>.</char></note>Umu Yuda uwabwanaloli we yula yo mu Yuda mumoyo wake. Ukusilimuliwa kwa bwanaloli, ko kusilimuliwa kwa moyo, ko kubombiwa mwambepo, ni ndaghilo awe syo sisimbiwe. Umundu yuyuyu atakupaliwa na bandu, loli nu Chala.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Imba bwisa buki bo bulipo pakuba mu Yuda? Pamo bwisa buki bo bulimo mukusilimuliwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ubwisa bulipo ngani pakuba mu Yuda. Ichindu cha bwandilo, u Chala akabapa aba Yuda amasyu ghake ukuti baghasunge. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Imba pala bamo batakabanga basubiliwa? Imba ichi chikung’anamula ukuti u Chala atangaba wa kumusubila, chifukwa ichakusita pakuba basubiliwa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Awe, napo papala! U Chala abe wabwanaloli, napo umundu wesi mumyasi. Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Ube we wabwanaloli, po ukuyugha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">sona po ukulongiwa inongwa, ubaghile ukupota inongwa yako bo ukulongiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Loli pala ubusita bugholoke bwitu bukulangisya ubugholoke bwa Chala, imba tungati choni? Imba tungayugha ukuti u Chala te mugholoke, bo akutufunda? (Nguyugha fififi ukuyana namo abandu bamo bakuyughila.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Awe, napo papala! Pala u Chala te mugholoke, imba angachilonga buli ichisu chapasi?<verse eid="ROM 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Umundu yumo angayugha ukuti, “Pala ubumyasi bwangu bukulangisya ukukila u bwanaloli bwa Chala, nu kongelesya ubughindikiwa bwake, imba choni cho ndongiwe ngati ne wambibi?” <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Po choni cho tutakayugha ukuti, “Sa tubombe ifibibi ukuti ubwisa bwise?” Naloli abandu bamo bakutusamula chifukwa tukuyugha ifindu fififi! Abandu baba ukufundiwa kwabo kubabaghile.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nayumo umundu yo mugholoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Po tungati choni? Imba utwe twe ba Yuda twe bisa ukukila abandu abapanja? Awe, napo papala!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aba Yuda te bisa ukukila napo panadi: pamo tuli nindamyo ukukila abandu ba panja? Te musila syosi awe!</char></note> Twabonesya kale ukuti aba Yuda na bandu ba panja, twebosi poka tuli pasi pa bulaghili bwa mbibi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 4:1-3">Mas4.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:1-3">53.1-3</ref>.</char></note> Ngati mo kasimbiliwe ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Nayumo umundu yo mugholoke, <verse eid="ROM 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />nayumo umundu yo akusyaghannya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">pamo yo akulonda pakumumanya u Chala. <verse eid="ROM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Bosi bapaghukila kumbali,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">bosi banangite nayumo yo akubomba cho chisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">napo weka bubu. <verse eid="ROM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />Utumilo twabo twasamite ngati gho mapumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">indimi syabo siswile nu bumyasi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">Amasyu aghakoghofya gho ghakufuma mumilomo yabo ghayanite bubu ni salile sya njoka. <verse eid="ROM 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Mas10.7</ref>.</char></note>Mumilomo yabo yiswile ni fighune,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:14">sona namasyu aghakubaba.<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Yis59.7-8</ref>.</char>
    </note> Ifinama fyabo fipepe ngani pakukupula ibanda,<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />kosi ko bakubuka, bakuleka ifisami ni ndamyo syene.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Batayimenye isila ya mutende,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />sona batakumoghopa u Chala napo papala.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Ipano tusimenye ukuti fyosi fyo indaghilo sikuyugha, sikuyungha nisya bandu bo bali pasi pa ndaghilo, umwakuti patakabe napa kulyeghela napamo pamo, sona nukuti bosi bakwisa pakulongiwa nu Chala. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:2">Mas14.2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 7:7">Aba Lom7.7</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal2.16</ref>.</char></note> Pakuti atalipo umundu yo u Chala akuyugha ukuti mugholoke pamaso papake chifukwa cha kukonga indaghilo. Ukwendela mundaghilo sikutupela ukuti tumanye ukuti twananga.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mo u Chala akubayughila abandu pakuba bagholoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Loli ipano isila yo u Chala akubayughila abandu pakuba bagholoke pamaso papake yafumbuliwa. Isila yake te po pakukonga indaghilo awe, napo indaghilo isya Mozesi na basololi sikubikila ubwakamboni. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />U Chala akabayugha abandu pakuba bagholoke pamaso papake ukwendela mu lwitiko lwabo mwa Yesu Kilisitu. U Chala akabomba sisisi ku bandu bosi bo bakumusubila u Kilisitu, chifukwa patalipo ukulekana nakumo, <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />pakuti abandu bosi banangite, sona bapotwa pakufikapo pa bughindikiwa bwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Bosi bakuyughiwa ukuti bagholoke muchisa chake ukwendela mwa Kilisitu Yesu, yo akubapoka. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />U Chala akamubika pakuba chakwiyipa, ukuti ukwendela mu bufwe bwake imbibi sya bandu sihobokeliwe, ku bo bakumusubila. Akabomba bububu ukulangisya ubugholoke bwake, chifukwa cha bufisalyoyo bwake ukuti atakabafundile nganila abandu bo bakananga. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Loli ipano u Chala amusala ukuti alangisye ubugholoke bwake. Pakubomba sisisi akilangisya mwene ukuti mugholoke, sona nukuti akubayugha abandu bosi pakuba bagholoke, bo bakusubila mwa Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Imba po tungitufya ni choni? Nachimo chimo! Imba ndaghilo siki? Indaghilo sya mbombo? Awe, loli indaghilo sya lwitiko. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:39">Imbo13.39</ref>.</char></note> Pololi tukusyaghannya ukuti umundu akuyughiwa mugholoke mu lwitiko ukusita ukubomba imbombo sya ndaghilo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Imba u Chala we Chala wa ba Yuda bene? Imba te we Chala uwa bapanja bope? Naloli, we Chala uwa ba panja bope. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:8">Gal3.8</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 3:20">20</ref>,<ref loc="GAL 3:28">28</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Chala ali weka, akwisa pakubapela bo basilimuliwe pakuba bagholoke ukwendela mu lwitiko lwabo, sona akwisa pakubayugha bo batasilimuliwe pakuba bagholoke ukwendela mulwitiko lwabo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Imba ichi chikung’anamula ukuti tukunanga indaghilo mu lwitiko lwitu? Awe, napo papala. Mubuyo bwake, tukusipela indaghilo pakuba syamaka.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ulwitiko lwa Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Po tungati choni nisya Abulahamu, umunyenya uwa luko lwitu? Imba akakomanapo ni choni? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Pala u Abulahamu angayughiwa pakuba mugholoke chifukwa cha mbombo, ngali ali nacho chimo icha kwitufikisyapo, loli pamaso pa Chala awe. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Ubw15.6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gal3.6</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti choni? “U Abulahamu akamusubila u Chala, sona chifukwa cha lwitiko lwake u Chala akumuyugha pakuba mugholoke.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:6">Aba Lom11.6</ref>.</char></note>Umundu yo akubomba imbombo akupokela amalipilo ghake, amalipilo ghake ghatayanite ni chabupi awe, loli abaghile ukupokela cho abaghile pakupokela. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Loli umundu yo atakubomba imbombo, akumusubila u Chala yo akumuyugha uwambibi pakuba mugholoke, ulusubilo lwake lukuyughiwa pakuba lugholoke. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />U Devedi akayugha bububu bo ayugha ukuti musayiwa umundu yo u Chala akumuyugha pakuba mugholoke, te kokuti chifukwa cha mbombo syake; Akati<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Mas32.1-2</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Basayiwa abandu bo ububibi bwabo bwahobokeliwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">bo imbibi syabo syakupikiliwa.<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Musayiwa umundu yo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">u Malafyale atakwisa pakusibelengela imbibi syake!”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Imba ubusayiwa bwa bene bo basilimuliwe pamo na bo batasilimuliwe? “Pakuti tukuti, ulwitiko lwa Abulahamu lukabelengiwa pakuba lugholoke.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Imba sisisi sikabombiwa lighi? Imba bo u Abulahamu atasilimuliwe pamo bo asilimuliwa kale? Sitakabombiwa bo asilimuliwe, loli bo atasilimuliwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:11">Ubw17.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:9">Luk19.9</ref>.</char></note>Akapokela ukusilimuliwa, ukuti chibe chimanyilo, nukusimikisya ubugholoke bwa lwitiko, u Chala akumuyugha pakuba mugholoke, bo atasilimuliwe. Po u Abulahamu mu nyenya wa bosi bo bakumusubila u Chala, sona bakwitikisiwa pakuba bagholoke ku kwake, napo batasilimuliwe. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Sona munyenya wa bo basilimuliwe, te kokuti ku bene bo bakasilimuliwa, loli sona na ku bosi bo bakukonga munyayo sya lwitiko lwa munyenya witu u Abulahamu, bo atasilimuliwe.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipangano lya Chala likupokeliwa ukwendela mu lwitiko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gal3.29</ref>.</char>
    </note>Bo u Chala akupangana nu Abulahamu na baluko lwake ukuti ichisu chapasi chikwisa pakuba chabo, akabomba bububu te chifukwa chakuti u Abulahamu akifwila indaghilo, loli chifukwa chakusubila nukuyughiwa ukuti mugholoke pamaso pa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Pala bo bakusikonga indaghilo bakwisa pakupyana, ulwitiko lwabo lwa bubu, sona ipangano lya Chala lite ni mbombo. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Pakuti indaghilo sikwisa nu bukalale bwa Chala. Loli pala sitakabangako indaghilo, nge kutaliko ukunanga. <verse eid="ROM 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:22">Gal3.22</ref>.</char></note>Po ipangano limilile pa lwitiko, umwakuti lipeghiwe mu chisa, ukuti ipangano lipeghiwe kubaluko losi ulwa Abulahamu te ko ku bene bo bakukonga indaghilo, awe, loli sona na kubo bali nu lusubilo lwa Abulahamu, yo we tata wa twebosi. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti, “Nakupela uwe pakuba we tata wa luko losi.” U Abulahamu akapokela ipangano ili kwa Chala yo akamusubila u Chala yo akasusya abafwe, sona nukufipa ifindu ubumi fyo fite nubumi. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Ubw15.5</ref>.</char></note>U Abulahamu akamusubila nukulindilila, napo patakaba ni chifukwa chakulindilila, po akaba we wise wa luko losi ukuyana na masimbo aghakuti, “Abaluko lwako bakwisa pakuba bingi ngani ngati ndondwi.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Ubw17.17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:11">18.11</ref>.</char></note> Ulusubilo lwake lutakayungana, bo akwinong’ona nisya mubili wake, gho ghukaba ngati ghufwile, chifukwa akaba ngati nifinja ifyakukwana wanu handiledi, pamo bo akwinong’ona nisya bughumba bwa mukasi u Sala. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Atakilamwa nipangano lya Chala, loli akiyula ngani mulwitiko lwake nukumughindika u Chala. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Ubw18.14</ref>.</char></note>Naloli akamusubila ukuti u Chala akwisa pakubomba syo akapangana. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ukwendela mu lwitiko lwake, u Chala, “Akamuyugha pakuba mugholoke.” <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:6">1 Kol10.6</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 10:11">11</ref>.</char></note> Amasyu ghakuti, “Akayughiwa ukuti mugholoke” Ghatakasimbiwa ku kwake mwene. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Loli ghakasimbiwa sona kukwitu, utwe twe tubaghile pakuyughiwa ukuti twe bagholoke, bo tukusubila mumwake yo akamususya kubufwe u Yesu u Malafyale witu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-6">Yis53.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:17-20">1 Kol15.17-20</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:21">1 Pit1.21</ref>.</char></note> Akabikiwa ukuti aghoghiwe chifukwa cha mbibi situ, sona akamususya kubufwe, umwakuti tuyughiwe pakuba bagholoke.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Twayughiwa ukuti twe bagholoke pamaso pa Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Ipano pakuti twayughiwa ukuti twe bagholoke pamaso pa Chala ukwendela mu lwitiko, tuli nu mutende nu Chala ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu u Malafyale witu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ukwendela mumwake atwighulila isila ukwendela mu lwitiko ukuti tuchimanye ichisa cha Chala, cho tuli nacho losulu. Po tukusekela, bo tukulindilila ukubeghana nabo ubughindikiwa bwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Te popa papo pene awe, loli tukusekela sona mundamyo situ chifukwa tusimenye ukuti mundamyo tukumanyilamo ukukiba, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />ukukiba kukumupelela umundu pakuba na akayilo akisa, sona akayilo akisa ka kumupela umundu pakuba nu lusubilo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Ulusubilo ulu lutakutukosya isoni, chifukwa ulughano lwa Chala lwapunguliwa mu myoyo yitu ukwendela mwa Mbepo Mwikemo, yo akatupa utwe.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Bo tukali tutenamaka, u Kilisitu akatufwila utwe twe bambibi pakabalilo akisa ko u Chala akasala. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Chindu chipala ngani ukuti umundu amufwile yumo, napo angabapo yumo umugholoke. Pamo angabapo yumo yo angakiba pakumufwila umundu umugholoke. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Loli u Chala akalangisya mo atughanile utwe pakuti u Yesu akatufwila bo tukali twe bambibi. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Pakuti mwibanda lyake lyatupela pakuba bagholoke pamaso pa Chala. Po akwisa pakutupoka kubukali bwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:20-21">1 Kol1.20-21</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti tukaba balughu ba Chala, tukasayana nawe ukwendela mu bufwe bwa Mwana wake. Pakuti ipano twasayana nu Chala, tukwisa pakupokiwa ukwendela mu bumi bwake! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Te popapa pene, loli utwe tukusekela mwa Chala ukwendela mwa Malafyale witu u Yesu Kilisitu, yo ipano atusayannya utwe nu Chala.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu nu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 3:6">Ubw3.6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pololi ukuyana namo imbibi yikisila mu chisu ichapasi ukwendela mu mundu weka, sona nu bufwe ukwendela mumbibi, musila yiyi ubufwe bukisa ku mundu wesi, chifukwa wesi akananga. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Imbibi yikabamo muchisu chapasi bo indaghilo sitabikiwe. Loli po pate indaghilo, abandu batangayughiwa ukuti bambibi. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Loli ukwandila pakabalilo ka Adamu mupaka pakabalilo ka Mozesi, ubufwe bukaba nu bulaghili napa bo batanangite, ukusita ukukonga indaghilo ngati mo u Adamu akabombelagha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">U Adamu akaba chifwanikisyo cha yo akwisa. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Loli ichabupi cha pabu tutangayanisya nu kunanga kwa bandu, pakuti abingi bakafwa chifukwa cha kunanga kwa mundu weka yula, ngani ngani ichisa cha Chala sona ni chabupi cha pabu cha mundu weka u Yesu Kilisitu, chikababalila abandu abingi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Po ichabupi cha pabu icha Chala chitakuyana nu kunanga kwa mundu weka. Pakuti ukulongiwa kwa umundu weka yula kukisa nu bubibi. Loli ichabupi ichapabu chikufuma ku bubibi ubwingi nu kutubika ku bugholoke. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Chifukwa cha kunanga kwa mundu weka ubufwe bukanda pakuba nu bulaghili chifukwa cha mundu weka yula. Loli bo bakupokela ichisa, fyo fikubalila ni chabupi cha bugholoke, umwakuti bakwisa pakuba nu bumi mu bunyafyale bwa mundu weka, yo we Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Po ukuyana ni mbibi ya mundu weka yikabapelela abandu bosi ukuti bafundiwe, umwakuyana bubu ni mbombo ya mundu weka umugholoke yikubapela abandu bosi pakuba bagholoke nu kubapa ubumi. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Pakuti ukuyanamo abandu abingi bakabela bambibi chifukwa chakusita ukwifwila kwa mundu weka, umwakuyana bubu, abandu abingi bakwisa pakubapela ukuba bagholoke chifukwa cha kwifwila kwa mundu weka.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Indaghilo sikapeghiwa ukuti imbibi syongelele, loli bo imbibi sikongelela, ichisa cha Chala chope chongelelagha ngani. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Po ukuyanamo imbibi sikabela nu bulaghili chifukwa cha bufwe, po sona ichisa cha Chala mo chibelile nu bulaghili ukwendela mu bugholoke ukutulongosya utwe ku bumi bwa bwile na bwile ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu, u Malafyale witu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Ukufwa kumbibi nukuba nu bumi mwa Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Po tungati choni? Imba twendelelaghe pakwikala mu mbibi ukuti ichisa chongelelepo? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Awe, napo papala! Utwe twafwile ku mbibi, po imba tungendelela buli buli pakwikala mu mbibi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Imba mutasimenye ukuti twe bosi po tukosiwa mwa Kilisitu Yesu, tukosiwa sona mu bufwe bwake? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:11">Aba Lom8.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 2:12">1 Kol2.12</ref>.</char></note> Pololi mu losyo tukasiliwa poka nawe mu bufwe, umwakuti ngati mo u Kilisitu akasyukila kubufwe mu bughindikiwa bwa Wise, po umwakuyana bubu, nutwe twikale nu bumi ubupya.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 3:10-11">Filp3.10-11</ref>.</char>
    </note> Pakuti pala tukwikala poka nawe mu bufwe bwake, tukwisa pakwikala nawe poka pakusyuka kubafwe ngati mo akasyukila. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Tusimenye ukuti ingalo yitu ingulu yikakomeliwa poka nu Yesu pambinjika, ukuti ingalo situ isya mbibi sinanganike, umwakuti tutakabe sona basya ba mbibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Pala umundu afwa, asatuliwa ku bulaghili bwa mbibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Loli pala tufwile poka nu Kilisitu, tukusubila ukuti tukwisa pakuba sona nu bumi poka nawe. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Pakuti tusimenye ukuti u Kilisitu asyukite ku bufwe, po te akafwe sona, ubufwe bute nu bulaghili papake. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ubufwe bo akafwa, akafwa ku mbibi lyoka. Po ubumi bo akaba nabo bo bumi mwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:19-20">Gal2.19-20</ref>.</char></note>Umwakuyana bubu, mwimanye mwebene pakuba ngati mwe bandu abafwe ku mbibi, loli muli nu bumi kwa Chala mwa Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Pololi mutakitikisye ukuti imbibi yilamulilaghe imibili yinyu imifwe, umwakuti mwifwile ifinyenwa fyake. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Mutakiyipe ichigaba chimo icha mubili winyu ku mbibi ukuti chibombe imbombo imbibi. Loli mwiyipe mwebene kwa Chala, ngati bandu bo basyuka bubu kubufwe, sona bali nu bumi. Mwiyipe imibili yinyu kwa Chala ukuti yibombe imbombo ingoloke. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:2">Aba Lom8.2</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti imbibi yitakwisa pakuba nu bulaghali papinyu chifukwa mute pasi pa bulaghili bwa ndaghilo, loli pasi pachisa cha Chala.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukuba basya ba bugholoke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Po imba tutichoni? Imba tubombe imbibi chifukwa tuli pasi pa bulaghili bwa lulaghilo, loli tuli pasi pa chisa cha Chala? Awe, napo papala! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Imba mutasimenye ukuti bo mukwiyipa mwebene ukuti mube basya ba mundu yo mukumwifwila ko kuti mwe basya ba mundu yo mukumwifwila. Sona pala mwe basya ba mbibi timufwe. Loli pala mwe basya ba Chala, timube bagholoke. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Loli amapalo ghabe kwa Chala, napo kale mukaba mwe basya ba mbibi, loli ipano mukwifwila nu moyo winyu ghosi, ubwanaloli buli mufimanyisyo fyo mukapokela. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Umwe mukasatuliwa ku mbibi, sona ipano mwaba basya ba babugholoke.<verse eid="ROM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Nguyugha ukuyana nu bundu chifukwa chakupotwa ukuyana ni mibili yitu. Kale mukiyipa mwebene pakuba mwe basya bafinyali nu bunyonganu, umwakuyana bubu, mubaghile mwiyipe mwebene ngati mwe basya ba bugholoke, ukuti mubebikemo.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Po mukaba basya ba mbibi, mukaba basatuke ku bugholoke. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Imba mukakabapo choni pakubomba ifindu fyo ipano fikubakosya isoni? Pakuti ubumalilo bwa kubomba ifindu ifi, bo bufwe! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Loli pakuti ipano mwasatuliwa ku mbibi, po mwaba mwe basya ba Chala. Cho mwakabapo bo bwikemo, sona ubumalilo bwake bo bumi bwa bwile na bwile. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Pakuti amalipilo gha mbibi, bo bufwe. Loli ichabupi icha Chala, bo bumi bwa bwile na bwile mwa Kilisitu Yesu u Malafyale witu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ichifwanikisyo cha Nyegha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Mwee bakamu bangu, imba mutasimenye ukuti nguyugha na bandu bo basimenye indaghilo, indaghilo yili nu bulaghili pa mundu pene po akali mumi? <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Umwakufwanikisya, nu mukolo yo asenyiwa apinyiwa ni ndaghilo kumulume wake pene po akali mumi. Loli pala umulume wake afwa, po akusatuliwa ku ndaghilo syo sikamupinya ku mulume. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Pololi pala akusenyiwa nu mwanalume umunine, bo umulume akali mumi, po akwisa pakwitisiwa ukuti mulowe. Loli pala umulume afwa, umukolo yula musatuke, sona atakulowa pala akusenyiwa sona nu mwanalume umunine.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Mwee bakamu bangu, momo sibelile numwe, numwe mukafwa kundaghilo mu mubili wa Kilisitu, yo akasyuka kubufwe, umwakuti tumwelele iseke u Chala. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Pakuti bo tukali tuli kumubili, ifinyenwa ifya mbibi ifya ndaghilo fikabomba imbombo mumibili yitu, ukuti fyele iseke sya bufwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:6">2 Kol3.6</ref>.</char></note>Loli ipano twe basatuke ku ndaghilo, chifukwa tukafwa kucho chikatupinya utwe, po tutakubombela sona mundaghilo sya kale syo sikasimbiwa awe, loli tukubombela musila imbya iya mwa Mbepo.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indaghilo ni mbibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:17">Ukf20.17</ref>.</char>
    </note>Imba tungati choni? Tungati indaghilo sikunanga? Awe! Loli pala sitaliko indaghilo, po ngali ndasimenye imbibi mo sibelile. Pakuti ngali ndasimenye ukuti ichinyenwa mbibi, pala indaghilo sitambusisye ukuti, “Utakanyenwaghe. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:56">1 Kol15.56</ref>.</char></note>Loli imbibi yikalwaghilamo ulusako mundaghilo ulwakumbelela une mufinyenwa ifyakulekana lekana. Pakuti pakusita indaghilo, imbibi yakufwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Une kale ngaba mumi bo indaghilo sitalipo. Loli bo indaghilo sisa, imbibi yikasyuka, po une ngafwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Sona indaghilo syo sikaba sya kumba ubumi, ngaghe sikunyisila nu bufwe. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Ubw3.13</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti imbibi yikalwagha ulusako, sona ukwendela mu ndaghilo, imbibi yikasimbula nukungogha.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:8">Mas19.8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pololi indaghilo yikemo, ilamulo likemo, sona ubugholoke bwisa. <verse eid="ROM 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Imba ichindu ichisa, chambelite ukuti ifwe une? Awe, napo papala! Loli imbibi yo yikambelela ubufwe ukwendela mumbombo inyisa, umwakuti imbibi yikalangisiwa ngati mbibi, sona ukwendela mwilamulo, imbibi yikalangisiwa ngati yo mbibi ngani.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubulwe mukati mumwitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Tusimenye ukuti indaghilo sya mbepo. Loli une ne wakumubili, ngulisiwe pakuba musya wa mbibi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal5.17</ref>.</char></note>Une ndakwifwisya cho ngubomba. Pakuti ndakubomba cho ngulonda pakubomba, loli ngubomba syo sibengite. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Sona pala ngubomba cho ndakulonda pakubomba, kokuti ngwitika ukuti indaghilo nyisa. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Po une tene nengubomba sisisi, loli mbibi yo yikwikala mumwangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Pakuti simenye ukuti nachimo ichisa cho chikwikala mumwangu, kokuti bundu bwangu ubwa mbibi. Napo ngulonda pakubomba ichisa, loli ngupotwa pakuchibomba. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Pakuti ndakuchibomba ichisa cho ngulonda pakubomba, loli ngubomba ichibibi cho ndakulonda pakubomba. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Po pala ngubomba cho ndakuchilonda pakubomba, kokuti te nene ne nguchibomba, loli imbibi yo yikwikala mumwangu.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Pololi ngusyagha indaghilo isyakuti, po ngulonda pakubomba ichisa, ngwagha ububibi bukubonekela mumwangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 1:2">Mas1.2</ref>.</char></note> Pakuti umoyo wangu ghukuhoboka ngani ni ndaghilo sya Chala, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />loli ngutesya ululaghilo ulunine mumubili wangu, lukulwana nu lulaghilo lwa moyo wangu, sona lwambela pakuba musya wa ndaghilo sya mbibi syo sikwikala mu mubili wangu. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ne mundu umupotwe une, Imba we wenu yo amboke ku mubili wa bufwe ughu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:57">1 Kol15.57</ref>.</char></note>Amapalo ghabe kwa Chala, yo akubomba isi ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu u Malafyale witu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Pololi une nemwene ni nyinong’ono syangu, ne musya wa ndaghilo sya Chala, loli ku bundu bwangu ubwa mbibi, ne musya wa ndaghilo sya mbibi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Ubumi bwa mwa Mbepo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Pololi ipano, ataliko nayumo yo angabasusya bo bakwikala mwa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Pakuti indaghilo sya Mbepo mwa Kilisitu Yesu, sisatwile ku ndaghilo sya mbibi na kubufwe bubu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Pakuti cho indaghilo yikapotwa pakubomba, chifukwa cha kuyeta kwa mubili, u Chala akabomba pakutuma umwana wake mwene mukabilo ka mubili wa mbibi, sona chifukwa cha mbibi, akatisyamo imbibi mu mubili. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />U Chala akabomba isi ukuti ubugholoke bwa indaghilo bukwanisiwe mu mwitu, twe tutakwendela isya mu mubili, loli isya mwa Mbepo.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Pakuti Abandu bo bakwikala ukuyana nubundu, bakubika inyinong’ono syabo pa finyenwa ifya mubili. Loli bo bakwikala ukuyana nisya mwa Mbepo, bakubika inyinong’ono syabo pa finyenwa ifya mwa Mbepo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Pakubika inyinong’ono pafya mubili, ubumalilo bwake bufwe. Loli pakubika inyining’ono pafya mwa Mbepo bo bumi nu mutende. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Pakuti syo umubili ghukwinong’ona silughu kwa Chala, po sitakwifwila indaghilo sya Chala, naloli sitangifwilapo. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Po bo bakubika inyinong’ono syabo pafya mubili, batangamuhobosya u Chala.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Loli umwe mutakwikala ngati mo ubundu bukubabusikisya umwe, pala naloli u Mbepo wa Chala akwikala mumwinyu. Loli pala yo ate nu Mbepo uwa Kilisitu, ate wa Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Loli pala u Kilisitu ali mumwinyu, napo imibili yinyu yifwile chifukwa cha mbibi, loli u mbepo winyu bumi chifukwa cha bugholoke. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kol3.16</ref>.</char></note>Sona pala u Mbepo wa Chala yo akamususya u Yesu kubufwe akwikala mumwinyu, po wepe yo akamususya u Kilisitu u Yesu kubufwe akwisa pakuyipa imibili yinyu ubumi imifwe, ukwendela mwa Mbepo wake yo akwikala mumwinyu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Pololi bakamu bangu, tuli ningongole, loli ingongole yake te yakuti twikale ukuyana nu bundu awe. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Pakuti pala mukwikala ukuyana nubundu bwinyu mukwisa pakufwa. Loli pala mo mwa Mbepo mukughogha imbombo imbibi isya mubili, mukwisa pakuba nu bumi. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Pakuti abandu bo bakulongosiwa nu Mbepo wa Chala, bana ba Chala. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:12">1 Kol2.12</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:5-6">Gal4.5-6</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Mbepo yo mukapokela te wakuti abapele basya bakoghopa. Loli u Mbepo akubapela pakuba bana, bo tukulila ukuti, “Abba, Tata!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />U Mbepo wa Chala akusimikisya poka nu mbepo witu ukuti utwe twe bana ba Chala. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Po pala twe bana ba Chala, twebakupyana, po sona twebakupyana poka nu Kilisitu pala tukukomana nawe mundamyo syake umwakuti tughindikiwe nawe poka.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubughindikiwa ubwa mundasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Une ngwinong’ona ukuti indamyo syo tuli nasyo ipano tutangafwanikisya nu bughindikiwa bo bukwisa pakufumbuliwa ku kwitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Pakuti Ifipeliwa fyosi fikulindilila nu kusubila ukuti u Chala abafumbulile abana bake. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Pakuti ifipeliwa fitakapeliwa ukuti fitakabe nimbombo, nubwighane bwake awe, loli nubwighane bwa Chala yo akalonda ukuti fibe bula bula mulusubilo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />ukuti ifipeliwa fyosi fikwisa pakusatuliwa kubusya ubwa kubola nukupokela ubusatuke nu bughindikiwa bwa bana ba Chala.<verse eid="ROM 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Pakuti tusimenye ukuti fipeliwa fyosi fikukuta nu bubafu ngani ngati mukolo pakabalilo akakusayiwa. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Loli te fipeliwa fyene fyo fikukuta; utwe twe tuli ni seke isyabwandilo isya Mbepo, nutwe tukukuta mukati kati, bo tukulindilila ukuti u Chala atupokele pakuba twe bana bake, sona nu kuyipoka imibili yitu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Pakuti utwe twapokiwa. Loli ulusubilo lo lukuboneka na maso, te lusubilo. Imba we wenu yo angakusubila cho akuchitesya? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Loli pala tukulindilila cho tukuchitesya, po tukuchilindilila nu bukifu.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Umwakuyana bubu, u Mbepo ukutwafwa ukufoka kwitu, pakuti utwe tutamenye namo tubaghile pakwiputila, loli u Mbepo Mwikemo akutwiputila nu kukuta, ko tutangayughiwa na masyu. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Sona u Chala yo akutesya mumyoyo yitu, asimenye mo u Mbepo akwitwinong’ononela, chifukwa u Mbepo akubiputila abandu ba Chala ukuyana nu bwighane bwake.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Tusimenye ukuti ifindu fyosi fikubendela akisa abandu bo bamughanite u Chala, bo bitisiwa ukuyana nu bwighane bwake. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Pakuti abandu bo u Chala akabasala kale, akabapaghulila pakuba ngati Mwana wake, umwakuti u Mwana wake abe ngati we katote mu bakamu abingi. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Po sona abandu bo u Chala akabapaghula, bope akabitisya, sona bo akabitisya, bakayughiwa pakuba bagholoke, sona akabeghana nabo ubughindikiwa bwake.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulughano lwa Chala mwa Kilisitu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Imba tungati choni, mu fyosi fififi? Pala u Chala ali nutwe, we wenu yo angatususya utwe? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />U Chala atakatwima u Mwana wake, loli akatupa chifukwa cha utwe twe bosi! Imba atangatupa sona ifindu fyosi? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Imba we wenu akwisa pakubasusya abandu bo basaliwa nu Chala? U Chala umwenecho weyo akubayugha ukuti bate ninongwa! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Imba we wenu yo angabasusya? Nayumo, pakuti Kilisitu Yesu akafwa chifukwa cha utwe, sona akasyuka kubufwe nukuba nu bumi, yo ali kunyobe indilo iya Chala, yo akutwiputila utwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Imba we wenu yo angatupaghulannya ku lughano lwa Kilisitu? Imba indamyo pamo ukutamiwa, pamo ukufwimiwa, pamo isala, pamo ukusita kuba ni fyakufwala, pamo ifyakoghofya, pamo ubufwe? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:22">Mas44.22</ref>.</char></note> Ngati mo amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Chifukwa cha umwe tukufwa isiku lyosi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Tuli ngati syo ng’osi syo sikubuka pakughoghiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Awe, loli mufindu fyosi fififi twe bakupota ukwendela mu yo akatughana utwe. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Pakuti simenye ukuti nachimo cho chingatupaghulannya utwe nu lughano lwake, napo bufwe pamo bumi, napo bandumi aba kumwanya pamo abalaghili, pamo ifya ipano pamo ifya mundasi pamo abamaka, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />napo butali bwa mumwanya napo butali bwa kuya pasi, napo findu fyosi mufipeliwa fyosi fyo fingatupaghulannya utwe ku lughano lwa Chala, loli mwa Kilisitu Yesu u Malafyale witu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">U Chala na bandu bake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Une nguyugha ubwanaloli mwa Kilisitu, sona ndakutamanda, umabyebye wangu akusimikisya ukwendela mwa Mbepo Mwikemo, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />indi ni chitima ichikulu ngani, sona nu kubaba mumoyo wangu ukusita kuleka. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Pakuti une nemwene nalondagha nguniwe kwa Chala nukutilako kwa Kilisitu, chifukwa cha bakamu bangu, abandu abaluko lwangu. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Abene bo ba Izilayeli bo u Chala akabasala ukuti babe bana bake nukubafumbulila ubughindikiwa bwake. U Chala akafingana nabo nukubapa indaghilo. Akabapa ulwa kumwiputa sona bapokele fyo bakapangana. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Abene bo baluko lwa banyenya bitu ko Kilisitu akafumila, po ukuyana nisya bundu. U Chala yo ali nu bulaghili bosi aghindikiwaghe bwile na bwile. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Loli te kokuti amasyu gha Chala ghakapotwa. Pakuti te bosi boba Izilayeli, bandu ba Chala. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Pamo te kokuti abaluko losi ulwa Abulahamu bana ba Chala. U Chala akati kwa Abulahamu, “Ukwendela mwa Ayizeki uluko lwako luyukwitisiwa.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ichi chikung’anamula ukuti abana bo bakupapiwa kumubili te bana ba Chala, loli bo bakapapiwa chifukwa cha pangano lya Chala bakwitisiwa baluko lwake. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Pakuti u Chala akapangana ukuti, “Pakabalilo kakaka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pakabalilo kakaka: Pamo pakabalilo kakaka ichinja cha ningelo.</char></note> ngwisa sona, po u Sala akwisa pakuba nu mwana umwanalume.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Sona te po papapo pene, awe. Loli abana babili aba Labeka bakaba nu wise weka, umunyenya witu u Ayizeki. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Loli bo amapasa batapapiwe, pamo bo botabombitepo nachimo ichisa pamo ichibibi, umwakuti ubwighane bwa Chala ubwakusalila nganila umundu wesi bubukilile, te chifukwa cha mbombo loli chifukwa cha yo akwitisya. <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Akamubusya u Labeka akati, “Usongo akwisa pakumubombela umupala.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Mal1.2-3</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti, “Ngamughana u Yakobo, loli ngamubenga u Esabo.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Kali po tungati choni? Imba tungayugha ukuti u Chala te mugholoke? Awe, napo papala. <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 33:19">Ezk33.19</ref>.</char></note>Umwene akamubusya u Mozesi akati, “Ngwisa pakuba ni chisa ku yo ngulonda pakumupelela ichisa, ngwisa pakumusaghila yo ngulonda pakumusaghila.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Pololi sitakukonga ubwighane bwa umundu pamo ukwiyula kwake awe, loli mu chisa cha Chala. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Pakuti amasimbo ghakuyugha kwa Falabo ghakuti, “Ngakwimika pakuba we Malafyale ukuti ngubombele ukuti ndangisye amaka ghangu, sona ukuti ufumusye ilita lyangu pachisu chosi ichapasi.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Pololi u Chala ali ni chisa pa wesi yo akulonda, sona akumukasya umoyo kuyo akulonda.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubukali bwa Chala ni chisa chake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Loli umundu yumo mumwinyu akwisa pakuyugha ukuti, “Imba choni cho u Chala akali akutwagha nindamyo? Imba we wenu yo angabukana ubwighane bwake?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Loli imba we wenu uwe ukuti umwamule u Chala? Imba isonda yikumulalusya umumatasonda ukuti, “Choni cho ukamata bububu?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Imba umumatasonda ate namaka pakubombesya ilongwi ukuyana namo akulondela, sona nukumata isonda sibili ni longwi lila lila, yimo yakubombela imbombo ya pamwanya sona iyingi iyisita kubaghila.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Imba tuti choni pala u Chala akalondagha pakulangisya ubukali bwake, sona nukulangisya amaka ghake, pololi akapilila ku fibombelo fyo akabaghila pakufikalipila sona fyo akatendekesya pakufinangannya. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Sona akalondagha pakufumbula ubughindikiwa bwake ubukulu, bo akapungulila utwe twe fibombelo mu chisa chake, sona akatendekesya bo akupokela ubughindikiwa bwake. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Pakuti twe akatwitisya, te mo mu ba Yuda bene awe, loli nukufuma mu bandu abapanja. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos2.23</ref>.</char></note>Ngati mo akayughila mwibuku lya Hoseya ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Abandu bo batakaba bangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">ngwisa pakubitisya ukuti, ‘Bandu bangu.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Uluko lo ndakalughana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">ngwisa pakulwitisya ukuti, ‘Lughaniwa lwangu.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hos1.10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Sona pamalo ghala ghala ghobakati ku kwabo, ‘Te mwe bandu bangu,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">pala pala bakwisa pakwitisiwa ukuti, ‘Bana ba Chala umumi.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:22">Yis10.22</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 10:23">23</ref>.</char>
    </note>Sona u Yisaya akalila ngani nisya ba Izilayeli akati, “Napo aba Izilayeli bingi ngani ngati musesenga wa munyanja, loli bapala bubu bakwisa pakupokiwa. <verse eid="ROM 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Pakuti u Malafyale akwisa pakutumula inongwa sya bandu aba muchisu sona nukumalisya umwalubilo.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Yis1.9</ref>.</char></note>Sona ngati mo u Yisaya akayughila kale ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Pala u Malafyale wamaka ghosi atakatulekelako abaluko bamo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ngali twaba ngati twaya twa Sodomu nu Gomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abapanja abingi bakasubila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Po imba tungati choni? Tungayugha ukuti abapanja bo batakalondagha ubugholoke babwagha, bo bugholoke ubwa mulwitiko, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />loli aba Izilayeli bo bakalondagha ubugholoke ubwa mundaghilo, bakapotwa ukubwagha mu ndaghilo sisisi. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Po imba choni? Chifukwa batakalondagha ukwendela mu lwitiko, loli ngati mumbombo syo bakabombagha. Po bakipunula ngani mwibwe lya kwipunula, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Yis28.16</ref>.</char></note>ngati mo kusimbiliwe ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Tesya, ngubika ibwe mu Ziyoni lyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">likwisa pakubapela abandu ukwipunula,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ilyalabwe lyo likwisa pakubawisya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Loli wesi yo akusubila mumwake, atakwisa pakukosiwa isoni.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Mwee bakamu bangu, cho ngulonda ngani mu moyo wangu, ngwiputa kwa Chala ukuti aba Izilayeli bangapokiwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Pakuti ngubasimikisya ukuti balweke pafindu ifya Chala, loli ulweke lwabo te lwa mahala. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Pakuti Batasimenye mo u Chala akubayughila abandu ukuba bagholoke pamaso papake, po pakulonda pakubwikasya ubugholoke bwabo bene, bakapotwa pakwiyipa kubugholoke bwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Pakuti u Kilisitu amalisya indaghilo, umwakuti wesi yo akusubila ayughiwaghe pakuba mugholoke.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupoki bwa bandu bosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev18.5</ref>.</char>
    </note> U Mozesi akasimba nisya bugholoke bo umundu angaba nabo pakusunga indaghilo po akati, “Umundu wesi yo akukonga indaghilo akuba nu bumi.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-13">Ukk30.12-13</ref>.</char></note>Loli ubugholoke bo bukufuma mulwitiko lukuti, utakayughe mu moyo wako ukuti, imba we wenu akwisa pakwingila kumwanya?’ ” (Kokuti ukumwisya pasi u Kilisitu.) <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />“Pamo Imba we wenu angika mu chipanga ichikulu cho chibilite ngani?’ ” (Kokuti akumusyusya u Kilisitu kubakufwa.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />“Loli imba amasyu ghakuti choni: Amasyu gha Chala ghali papipi numwe, ghali pamulomo wako, sona na mumoyo wako.” (Ko kuti gho masyu gha lwitiko gho tukulumbilila.) <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Pala ukwitika nu mulomo wako ukuti u Yesu we Malafyale sona nu ukusubila ukuti u Chala akamususya kubufwe, ukwisa pakupokiwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Pakuti umundu akusubila mu moyo wake nukuba mugholoke, sona numulomo wake akwitikisya mu lwitiko nu kupokiwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11">Yis28.11</ref>.</char></note>Amasimbo ghakuti, “Umundu wesi yo akusubila mumwake, atakwisa pakukosiwa isoni.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Pakuti patalipo ukupambana pakati pa ba Yuda na bapanja. Pakuti u Chala we Malafyale wa bosi, sona akubasaya ngani abandu bo bakumwitisya. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti, “Wesi yo akwitisya ilita lya Malafyale, akwisa pakupokiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Po imba abandu bangamwitisya buli yo batamusubile? Sona imba bangamusubila buli, pala batifwilepo lumo? Sona imba bangifwa buli, pala nayumo atalumbilile? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Sona imba bangalumbilila buli pala batatumiwe? Ngati mo amasimbo ghakuti, “Bwisa buki bo bukwisa nabandumi bo bakwisa na masyu amisa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:1">Yis53.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:38">Yoh12.38</ref>.</char>
    </note> Loli te bosi bo bakitikisya Amasyu Amisa. Pakuti u Yisaya akati, “Malafyale, we wenu yo akasubila amasyu ghitu?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Po ulwitiko lukwisa bo umundu ifwa amasyu, sona amasyu ghakwisa pala umundu alumbilila isya Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 19:4">Mas19.4</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:6">Kols1.6</ref>,<ref loc="COL 1:23">23</ref>.</char>
    </note> Loli ngulalusya ukuti: Imba batakifwa? Naloli bakaghifwa ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Isyu lyabo likifwika pachisu chosi ichapasi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">amasyu ghabo ghakafika kumbaka ya chisu ichapasi.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:21">Ukk32.21</ref>.</char>
    </note> Une ngulalusya sona: Imba kokuti aba Izilayeli batakifwisya? Pabwandilo po u Mozesi akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Ngwisa pakubapela umwe abakabini na bo te baluko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ngwisa pakubakalalisya umwe ukwendela muluko lo lulunganite.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Yis65.1</ref>.</char>
    </note>Sona u Yisaya akayugha nu bukifu ngani akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Ngaghiwa na bo batakandondagha.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Ngibonesya kubo batakandalusya une.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:2">Yis65.2</ref>.</char>
    </note>Loli nisya ba Izilayeli akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Isiku lyosi ngagholosya inyobe syangu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">kubo batakifwilagha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">sona nabalukani.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Ichisa cha Chala pa ba Izilayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:37">Yel31.37</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filp3.5</ref>.</char>
    </note>Po ngulalusya ukuti, imba u Chala akabakana abandu bake? Awe, napo papala. Pakuti une ne mu Izilayeli uwaluko lwa Abulahamu, uwa muchikolo cha Benjamini. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />U Chala atakabakana abandu bake awe, bo akabasalila nganila ukufuma ku bwandilo. Imba musimenye syo Amasimbo ghakuyugha nisya Eliya? Po akamulalusya u Chala ukuti abafunde aba Izilayeli ukuti, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Bany19.10</ref>,<ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref>.</char></note>“Malafyale, babaghoghite abasololi bako nukupongolannya ifighemo fyako, po une nasyala nemwene, sona bakughesya ukuti bangoghe.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Bany19.18</ref>.</char></note> Imba u Chala akamwamula buli buli? Akamwamula akati, “Nisungile nemwene abanalume seveni sabuzani, bo batamughindikitepo u Bala, u chala umumyasi yula.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Momo sibelile nipano, ukuti balipo bapala bubu bo u Chala akabasala mu chisa chake. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Loli pala mo muchisa chake, po batakasaliwa mu mbombo syobakubomba awe, pala sikaba bububu, ichisa chake ngali chitakaba chisa.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Po imba tungati choni? Cho aba Izilayeli bakalondagha batakachagha, loli bo bakasaliwa bakasyagha, po bo bakasyalako bakabakasya imyoyo yabo, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />ngati mo amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“U Chala akabapa imyoyo yabo pakuba mikafu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">amaso ghabo ukuti ghatakatesye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">sona makutu ghabo ghatakifwe, mupaka ipano.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Mas69.22-23</ref>.</char></note>Sona u Devedi akuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Ulusekelo lwabo lubateghe ngati chipingo ni ngoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">fyakubakola fibe fya kubapinga nu kufundiwa.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Amaso ghabo ghighaliliwe, umwakuti batakatesye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">sona akabalilo kosi imisana yabo yiname.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:6">Mas18.6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Une ngulalusya sona ukuti, “Imba bo bipunula bakawila nganila?” Awe, napo papala! Loli chifukwa chakunanga kwabo, ubupoki bwisa ku bapanja, ukuti aba Izilayeli babe bakabini. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Loli pala imbibi sya ba Yuda sikisa nubukabi bwa lusayo ulukulu ngani muchisu chapasi, sona ukupotwa kwabo kubapela abapanja ukuba bakabi, imba lusayo lukulu luki lukwisa pakubako bo ubwingi bwa ba Yuda bukongelelako.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubupoki bwa bandu ba panja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Une nguyugha numwe mwe bapanja. Une pakuba ngati ne mutumiwa pa bandu bapanja, ngwitufikisya chifukwa cha butumiwa bwangu bububu, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />ukuti pala momo sikabelagha ndangabapangila abaluko lwangu akabini, ukuti mbapoke bamo mumwabo. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Pakuti pala ukubakana kwabo kuli kwa kusayana ni chisu cha pasi, imba ukupokeliwa kwabo kwisa kuba buli? Loli ubumi ukufuma kubafwe!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Pala akamenyu akabwandilo kapeghiwa kwa Chala, kokuti chope ni chibama chosi chipaghuliliwe. Sona pala umusisi umwikemo, kokuti syope ni samba sikemo. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Loli pala isamba simo isya musyunguti syapalandiwa, po umwe mwe bapanja ngati samba isya misyunguti isya mungolongo mukumamatila kula kula, po mukubeghana nabo amafuta agha kufuma mwikomo lya musyunguti. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Po utakitufye wemwene ku kukasamba, pala ukwitufya wemwene, utakuwafwa umusisi loli umusisi ghukwafwa uwe.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Po mukwisa pakuyugha ukuti, “Isamba sikapalandiwa, umwakuti mamatiliwepo une.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Bwanaloli, bakapalandiwa chifukwa batakasubilagha, uwe ukwikala chifukwa cha kusubila, utakitufyaghe loli ghoghopaghe. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Pakuti pala u Chala atakasileka isamba mubuyo bwake, atayukubaleka numwe. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Pololi tesya ichisa cha Chala nu bukali bwake, mukali ku bo bakawa, loli ku umwe wa chisa pala mukubukilila ukwikala mu chisa chake, nukwendelela pakubomba fyo fikumuhobosya. Loli pala mutakubomba mukwisa pakupalandiwako. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Sona pala aba Yuda baleka ukusita ukusubila kwabo, bakwisa pakunyosiwa mubuyo bwabo bo bakabamo pakuti u Chala ali na maka pakumamatisya sona. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Umwe mwe bapanja muli ngati samba isya likomo ilya musyunguti uwa mungolongo lyo lipalandiwe sona lipambanite nilyenecho, limamatiliwe ku musyunguti gho ghubyaliwe, po chikwisa pakuba chipepe ngani kwa Chala pakumamatisya sona isamba kwikomo lyo lipalandiwe.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichisa cha Chala pa bosi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Mwee bakamu bangu, ndakulonda ukuti mube basita kumanya isya kubufifamu, umwakuti mutakisimbule ukuti mwe bamahala, ukuti ubukafu bwa myoyo bukisa papala ku ba Izilayeli, mupaka ukwisula kwa bapanja ku kisa kwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:21">Yis59.21</ref>.</char></note>Umu momo aba Izilayeli bosi bakwisa pakupokeliwa. Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Umupoki akwisa pakufuma mu Ziyoni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">sona nu kutisya ububibi bosi ubwa luko lwa Yakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:9">Yis27.9</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ulu lo lufingo lo ngwisa pakufingana nabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">bo ngutesya imbibi syabo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Chifukwa cha kukana Amasyu Amisa, aba Yuda bakaba balughu ba Chala chifukwa cha bandu bapanja. Loli chifukwa chakuti akabasala, baba bamanyani bake chifukwa cha banyenya babo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Pakuti ifyabupi fyake nu kwitisiwa kwa Chala pa mundu fitakupokiwa lumo. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ngati mo umwe mwe ba panja kale mutakamwifwila u Chala, loli akubafwila ichisa chifukwa chakusita kwifwila ukwa ba Yuda. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Umwakuyana bubu, chifukwa cha chisa cho mukapokela, ipano aba Yuda baba basita kumwifwila u Chala umwakuti bapokele ichisa cha Chala. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Pakuti u Chala akabapela abandu bosi pakuba bapinyiwa abasita kwifwila, umwakuti alangisye ichisa chake pa bosi.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akumupala u Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:8">Yis55.8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mwee, bo butali buki ubukabi ubwa Chala na mahala ghake nu bumanyi bwake! Imba we wenu yo angalingannya ubulongi bwake? Imba we wenu yo angifwisya isila syake?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Imba we wenu yo asimenye inyinong’ono sya Malafyale?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Imba we wenu yo angamulimbikisya?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Yob41.11</ref>.</char>
    </note>Imba we wenu yo amupilepo lumo ichabupi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">umwakuti u Chala amulipile papo?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 8:6">1 Kol8.6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pakuti ifindu fyosi fikapeliwa nawe, sona fili nu bumi ukwendela mumwake, sona fikubuka ku kwake, kwa Chala kube ulughindiko bwile na bwile! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ubumi bwa kumubombela u Chala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Pololi bakamu bangu, chifukwa cha chisa cha Chala ichikulu ngani kukwitu, ngubasuma ukuti mwiyipe imibili yinyu pakuba chakwiyipa cha bumi, ubwikemo sona iya kumuhobosya u Chala, koko kwiputa kwinyu ukwa mbepo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Mutakeghelelaghe ingalo sya bandu aba muchisu ichi, loli mumwitikisye u Chala ukuti andule ubumi bwinyu pakuba inyinong’ono imbya. Po mukwisa pakumanya ubwighane bwa Chala, pakumanya cho chisa, ichakumuhobosya, sona ichakufikapo.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Pakuti ichisa cho mbeghiwe une, nguyugha numwe mwebosi ukuti mutakipimaghe mwebene pakuba bapamwanya ngani ukukila namo mubelile, loli mube bakwiyisya imyoyo yinyu ukuyana ni chipimilo icha lwitiko lwinyu, lo u Chala abapile. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Pakuti ngati mo tubelile nifigaba ifingi mumubili ghoka, po ifigaba fyosi fili ni mbombo isyakulekana lekana. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Umwakuyana bubu, napo twe bingi, twe mubili ghoka mwa Kilisitu, sona tumamatisiwe ku munine na kumunine ngati figaba ifya mubili ghoka ifyakulekana lekana. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 12:4-14">1 Kol12.4-14</ref>.</char></note>Tuli ni fyabupi ifyakulekana lekana ukuyana namo u Chala akatupela mu chisa chake. Pala uli nichabupi cha kusolola, ubaghile pakubomba nacho ukuyana nu lwitiko lwako. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Pala ichabupi chako chakubomba, ubaghile pakubomba, pala chakumanyisya, ubaghile pakumanyisya. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Pala ichabupi chako cha kubakasya, ubaghile pakubomba bububu, pala kupeleka, ubaghile pakupeleka, pala mulongosi, alongosyaghe nu moyo ghosi, yo akubapelela abanine ichisa, abombe umwakuhoboka.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Ulughano lutakabe lwa bumyasi. Uchibenge cho chibibi, loli chikolelele cho chisa. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:3">Filp2.3</ref>.</char></note> Mughananaghe nu moyo ghosi ngati mwe bakamu. Mughindikanaghe mwebene. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Mutakabe bakata, loli mwiyuleghe mwa mbepo. Sona mu mubombelaghe u Malafyale umwakwiyipa nu moyo winyu ghosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Muhoboke mulusubilo lwinyu, mukibe mundamyo sinyu mubukilile pakwiputa akalilo kosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Mugabanaghe na ba Kilisitu abanyinyu bo bakusobelwa. Mupokelaghe abagheni.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44">Mat5.44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:28">Luk6.28</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mubasaye bo bakubafwima, mubasaye sona mutakabaghune, awe. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Hobokagha poka na bo bahobokite, lilagha poka na bo bakulila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 131:2">Mas131.2</ref>.</char></note>Mube nu moyo wa kwifwana na banyinyu bosi. Mutakitufyaghe, loli mwangale poka na bandu bo basuliwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">poka na bandu bubu: pamo mwitike pakubomba imbombo isya luko losi</char></note> Mutakipimaghe mwebene ukuti mwe bamahala ngani ukukila bosi.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Utakatanisyaghe ububibi pa bubibi. Cheba pakubomba cho chisa pamaso pa bandu bosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Pala chingabombiwa, mube mu mutende na bandu bosi. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35">Ukk32.35</ref>.</char></note>Mwe bakamu bangu, mutakatanisyaghe ububibi, loli mu mulekele u Chala ukuti atanisye mubukalale bwake. Pakuti amasimbo aghakuti, “Ukutanisya ko kwangu, une ngwisa pakutanisya.” U Malafyale akuyugha. <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Loli pala umulughu wako ali ni sala, umupe ichakulya, pala ali ni nyota, umupe amisi. Pakubomba bububu kokuti ukumukosya ni chibunga cha mulilo wa mababu pamutu pake.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Mutakitikisye ukuti ububibi bubapote, loli mubupote ububibi pakubomba inyisa.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Ukubifwila abalaghili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Umundu wesi abifwilaghe abalaghili, pakuti butalipo nabumo ubulaghili loli bo bukufuma kwa Chala. Ubulaghili bosi bo bulipo bukimikiwa nu Chala. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Pololi wesi yo akususannya nu bulaghili, akususannya na cho u Chala akimika. Sona wesi yo akubomba bububu akwisa pakwipelela mwene ubulongi. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Pakuti abalaghili batakuboghofya bo bakubomba inyisa, loli bo bakubomba ububibi. Imba ukulonda ukuti utakoghope ubulaghili? Bomba cho chisa, po ukwisa pakupaliwa, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />pakuti yo mulaghili mubombi wa Chala, yo akubombela inyisa. Loli pala ukubomba ichibibi, po ghoghopaghe, pakuti umulaghili atakukola upanga pabu, pakuti umwene mubombi wa Chala yo akwisa nubukalale nu kubafunda bosi bo bakubomba ububibi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Pololi, mubaghile pakubifwila abalaghili, te kokuti mukoghopa ubukali ubwa Chala bwene, loli chifukwa cha mabyebye.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat22.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Miko12.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk20.25</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ichi cho chifukwa mukusonga umusongo, pakuti bo bakulaghila babombi ba Chala bo bakupeleka akabalilo kabo kosi pa kubomba. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Mat22.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Miko12.17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luk20.25</ref>.</char></note>Po mubalipile fyosi fyo fibabaghile, pala gho musongo, musonge umusongo, pala gho musongo uwa katundu musonge, pala lughindiko, pamo mapalo fipeghiwe ku bandu bo fibabaghilile.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nisya kubaghana abanyitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Mutakabe ni ngongole nu mundu, loli ingongole yibe ya lughano. Pakuti wesi yo akumughana umunine akukwanilisya indaghilo. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev19.18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:39-40">Mat22.39-40</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti Indaghilo sikuti, “Utakalowaghe, utakaghoghaghe, utakibaghe, utakanyenwaghe” ni ndaghilo syosi isingi gho ghonganite pilamulo lyoka ilyakuti, “Umughane umupalamani wako ngati mo wighanile wemwene.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Pala yo amughana umupalamani, atangamubombela nachimo ichibibi. Po ulughano lukukwanilisya indaghilo.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Mubaghile pakubomba sisisi, chifukwa musimenye ukuti akabalilo kakwana akakuti mulamusye mutulo. Pakuti akabalilo kakupokiwa kali papipi ngani ukukila ko tukandilagha pakusubila. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Ubusiku buli papipi pakumala, umusanya ghuli papipi pakwanda. Po sa tusileke imbombo isya muchisi, po tufwale ifilwilo fya bwelu. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Sa tulangisye ingalo inyisa ukuyana na bandu bo bakwenda mubwelu ubwa pamusanya. Tutakabe bandu abapafu pamo baching’wela, tutakabe bamalaya pamo bapopo, tutakabe babwite pamo bakabini. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:27">Gal3.27</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 5:16">5.16</ref>.</char></note>Loli fwala u Malafyale u Yesu Kilisitu ngati chilwilo chinyu, po mutakinong’onele isya mubili syo ghukulonda.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Mutakabalongaghe abangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Mu mupokele umundu yo ulwitiko lwake lwakufoka, loli mutakadalingane nawe pa syo akwinong’ona. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Umundu yumo ulwitiko lwake lukumwitikisya pakulya ifindu fyosi, loli yumo ulwitiko lwake lwakufoka, akulya inyanyi isyamani syene. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 2:16">1 Kol2.16</ref>.</char></note>Umundu yo akulya ifindu fyosi atakamusamulaghe yo atakulya ifindu fyosi. Sona yo akulya ifindu fyosi, atakamulongaghe yo akulya ifindu fyosi, pakuti we Chala yo akamupokela. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Imba we wenu uwe ukuti umulongaghe uwambombo uwa yumo? We Malafyale wake mwene yo angatumula pala akubomba akisa pamo akupotwa. Po akwisa pakubomba akisa mundasi, pakuti u Malafyale weyo amenye pakumupela ukuti abombaghe akisa.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Umundu yumo akwinong’ona ukuti isiku limo lya pamwanya ngani ukukila amasiku ghosi aghangi, bo abanine bakwinong’ona ukuti amasiku ghosi ghayanite bububu. Umundu wesi abombaghe ukuyana namo asimikisisya mu nyinong’ono syake. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Wesi yo akwinong’ona ukuti isiku limo lya pamwanya ngani ukukila amasiku ghosi, akubomba bububu ukuti amughindikaghe u Malafyale. Po yo akulya ifindu fyosi, akubomba bububu ukuti amughindikaghe u Malafyale pakuti pakubomba bububu akumupalisya u Chala. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Nayumo mumwitu yo ali nu bumi pamwene, nayumo yo akufwa mwene. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Pala tuli nu bumi, tukwisa pakuba nu bumi chifukwa cha Malafyale, sona pala tukwisa pakufwa, tukwisa pakufwa chifukwa cha Malafyale, napo tube nu bumi pamo tufwe, twe bandu ba Malafyale. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Pakuti u Kilisitu akafwa nukusyuka kubufwe ukuti abe we Malafyale wa bandu abumi sona na bafwe. <verse eid="ROM 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31-32">Mat25.31-32</ref>.</char></note>Imba choni cho ukumulonga umukamu wako? Imba choni cho ukumusamula umukamu wako? Pakuti twe bosi tukwisa pakwimilila pandasi pa chitengo cha bulongelo bwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Yis45.23</ref>.</char></note> Pakuti kusimbiwe ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Po une indi nu bumi, u Malafyale akuyugha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">ifipefu fyosi fikwisa pakufughamilila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">po imilomo yosi yikwitikisya kwa Chala.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Pololi wesi mu mwitu akwisa pakwibelengela mwene kwa Chala.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukubaghana abanyitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Pololi, tuleke pakulongana. Mubuyo bwake, tuleke pakubomba fyo fingabapunusya abandu abangi, pamo pakubika ichisinga musila ya bandu abangi. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Pakumamatilana kwangu poka nu Malafyale u Yesu simenye ngani ukuti chitalipo ichindu chimo cho chinyalite pa chene bubu, loli pala umundu yo akuchipima ukuti chinyalite, po ichindu chila chila kukwake chinyalilte. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Pala ukumupela umukamu wako ukuti anange chifukwa cha fyakulya fyo ukulya, kokuti utamughanite umukamu yula yula. Utakamunange umukamu wako, yo u Kilisitu akamufwila, chifukwa cha fyakulya fyo ukulya. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Utakitisye ukuti ifindu fyo ukufipima ukuti fyisa, abandu bafiyughaghe ukuti fibibi. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Pakuti Ubunyafyale ubwa Chala bute nimbombo ni fyakulya ni fyakung’wa, loli ubwanaloli nu mutende, sona nu kuhoboka, fyo u Mbepo Mwikemo akupa. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Sona pala umundu akumubombela u Kilisitu bububu, akumuhobosya u Chala, sona nukupaliwa na bandu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Pololi sa tughesye ngani pakubomba ifindu fyo fya mutende, umwakuti tukasannye. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Mutakakanaghe imbombo ya Chala chifukwa cha fyakulya. Ifyakulya fyosi fyisa bubu pakulya. Loli chibibi ukuti umundu alye ichindu chosi cho chingamupela umundu uyungi ukuti anange. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Chisapo ukuleka pakulya inyama pamo ukung’wa ubwalwa bwa mafilu pamo pakubomba cho chingamupela umukamu wako ukuti anange. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Usungilile syo ukusubila nisya findu fififi pakati papako nu Chala. Musayiwa umundu yo atakwilonga mwene, bo asimikisya ukuti ichindu cho akubomba, chisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Loli pala umundu akukayikila nacho akulya, u Chala akumususya bo akulya, chifukwa imbombo syake sitimilile pa lwitiko. Sona ichindu chosi cho chitimilile palwitiko chibibi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Nisya kubahobosya abandu abangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Utwe twe bamaka mulwitiko tubaghile pakubafwa abakufoka pakunyamula indamyo syabo. Tutakihobosyaghe twebene bubu. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Mubuyo bwake, twebosi tubaghile pakuhobosya bakamu bitu nu kubabombela inyisa, umwakuti ulwitiko lwabo lukulaghe. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Mas69.9</ref>.</char></note>Pakuti u Kilisitu atakihobosya mwene ukuyana na masimbo aghakuti, “Umusamu gho bakamusamula nagho, ghukangwila.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Pakuti chosi cho chikasimbiwa kale mumasimbo, chikasimbiwa ukutumanyisya utwe, umwakuti tungaba nu lusubilo ukwendela mu bufisalyoyo nu lukasyo, lo Amasimbo ghakutumanyisya. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:2">Filp2.2</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:2">4.2</ref>.</char></note>U Chala yo akubapa abandu ubufisalyoyo nu lukasyo, abafwe ukuti mwifwanaghe akisa, bo mukukonga ichifwanikisya cha Kilisitu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />umwakuti mwebosi nisyu lyoka mu mughindikaghe u Chala, sona nu wise uwa Malafyale witu Yesu Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amasyu ghukulumbililiwa ku bapanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Pololi mupokelanaghe akisa ukuyana namo u Kilisitu akabapokelela, umwakuti u Chala apaliwaghe. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Pakuti ngubabusya ukuti u Kilisitu akaba mubombi pakati pa ba kusilimuliwa, ukulangisya ukuti u Chala musubiliwa, umwakuti asimikisye ipangano lyake, lyo akabalaghisya abanyenya babo, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:49">Mas18.49</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam22.50</ref>.</char></note>umwakuti na bandu ba panja bope bamughindikaghe u Chala chifukwa cha chisa chake ukuyana na masimbo aghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Chifukwa chichi ngwisa pakumughindika pakati pa bandu ba panja.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Ngwisa pakwimba inyimbo isyakupalisya ilita lyako.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Ukk32.43</ref>.</char>
    </note> Sisimbiwe sona ukuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Hoboka ngani mwe bapanja poka na bandu ba Chala.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Sona Amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mwe bandu mwe te mwe ba Yuda mumughindike u Malafyale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">sona mwe bandu abaluko losi mumughindike.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Sona wepe umusololi u Yisaya akati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Weka uwa banyenya aba Yese akwisa; pakuba mulaghili wa bandu ba panja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">po abene bakwisa pakusubila mumwake.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Umwenecho u Chala yo akutupa ulusubilo, abisusye nu lusekelo, sona nu mutende ukwendela mukusubila kwinyu mumwake, umwakuti ulusubilo lwinyu lwendelelaghe pakukula na maka gha Mbepo Mwikemo.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichifukwa cho u Pabuli akasimbila nu bukufu ngani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Mwee bakamu bangu, naloli isimenye ukuti umwe mwe bandu abisa, sona nukuti mufimenye fyosi akisa, sona nukuti mungamanyisannya. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Loli mwakalata uyu nasimbila nu bukifu ngani ifindu fimo, ukuti mbakumbusye. Nasimba bububu chifukwa cha chisa cha Chala, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />pakusala pa bandu ba panja. Ambile imbombo iyakulumbilila Amasyu Amisa agha Chala ngati ne muputi, umwakuti abandu ba panja babe chakwiyipa ichakumuhobosya u Chala, sona ni chakupaghuliliwa ku kwake nu Mbepo Mwikemo. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Pakumamatilana kwene poka nu Yesu Kilisitu, Indi ni chifukwa icha kwitufikisya nacho chifukwa cha mbombo yo ngumubombela u Chala. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ndakwisa pakutamiwa pakuyugha nisya chindu ichingi, awe loli syene syo u Kilisitu abomba ukwendela mumwangu ukuti imbafwe abandu ba panja pakumwifwila u Chala ukwendela mu masyu ghangu, sona ni mbombo syangu, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />sona nu kwendela mufimanyilo ni fiswigho, sona na maka gha Mbepo Mwikemo uwa Chala. Po ukwandila mu Yelusalemu mupaka mu Ililiko nalumbilila ngani amasyu agha Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Amasiku ghosi ngiyula ngani pakulumbilila amasyu, ko batamumenye u Kilisitu, umwakuti ndakasenge palwalo, lo umundu yumo asengite kale. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Pakuti amasimbo ghakuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Bo batakabusiwapo nalumo lumo nisya yo bakwisa pakumutesya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">sona bo batifwilepo nalumo lumo nisya yo bakwisa pakumwifwisya.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akubatika nisya kubuka ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Aba Lom1.13</ref>.</char>
    </note>Ichi cho chifukwa bwile napotwagha pakwisa kukwinyu. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Loli pakuti ipano na malisya imbombo yangu mufigaba ifi, sona nukuti nalondagha ngani ifinja ifingi ukuti nise pakubatesya, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />ngulindilila pakubomba bububu losulu, bo ngubuka ku Sipeni ukuti munyafwe pa bulendo bwangu. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Imbo19.21</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:17">24.17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:31">15.31</ref>.</char></note>Loli losulu indi pabulendo ubwakubuka mu Yelusalemu ni fyabupi ifya bandu aba Chala kula kula. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Pakuti ifipanga ifya mu Makedoniya nifya mu Akiya fikaba ni chisa ngani, umwakuti fikasangusya ifyabupi pakubafwa abandu abapina pakati pa bandu ababwanaloli aba Chala aba mu Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Chikabahobosya ngani pakubomba sisisi, sona yikaba mbombo yakubafwa abapina. Pakuti aba Yuda bakagabana na bandu babo ba panja ulusayo lwabo ulwa buzimu, po bope abandu ba panja babafwaghe aba Yuda ni findu fyo bakusobelwa ifya mubili. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Po bo namalisya imbombo yangu iyi, sona bo nabika ifyabupi fyosi fyo bakasangulila, ngwisa pakubendela, bo ngubuka ku Sipeni. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Simenye ukuti bo ngwisa kukwinyu, ngwisa nu lusayo ulukulu ulwa Kilisitu.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Mwee bakamu bangu mwa Malafyale witu Yesu Kilisitu, sona nukwendela mu lughano lwa Mbepo Mwikemo, ngubalambilisya ukuti mube poka nune munyiputo, ukunyiputila ngani kwa Chala. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Munyiputilaghe kwa Chala ukuti amboke munyobe sya bandu abasita lwitiko aba mu Yudeya. Sona mwiputaghe ukuti abandu ababwanaloli aba mu Yelusalemu bitikisye imbombo yangu, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />umwakuti mubwighane bwa Chala ningisa kukwinyu nu lusekelo, sona nukwilagha ngani pakwangala numwe. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />U Chala, yo mwenecho wa mutende, abe numwe mwe bosi. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">U Pabuli akubalamuka abitiki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ngumubika u Febi, umuyemba witu munyobe sinyu, sona yo mubombi uwa chipanga icha mu Kengeleya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Mu mupokelele akisa mwi lita lya Malafyale, ukuyana namo chibabaghilile abandu ba Chala pakubombelana, sona mumwafwe ni findu fyo akusobelwa nafyo pakuti umwene akubafwa abandu abangi poka nune bubu.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Imbo18.2</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mundamukileko u Pulisila nu Akwila, ababombi abanyitu mu mbombo ya Kilisitu Yesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />bo bakiyipa ubumi bwabo ukuti bamboke une, te nene nemwene ngubapalisya, loli ni fipanga fyosi ifya bandu bapanja. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Mundamukileko sona na bandu bo bakomana munyumba syabo pakwiputa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Mundamukileko umughaniwa wangu u Epaneto, yo akaba mundu wabwandilo muchigaba cha Asiya pakumusubila u Kilisitu. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Mundamukileko u Maliya, yo akiyula ngani pakubabombela umwe. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Mundamukileko Andoloniko nu Yuniya abanyitu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yuniya: Pamo Yuniyasi; Amasimbo ghamo amakulu ghakuyugha Yuliya.</char></note> bo bakaba poka nune mujela. Abene bandu bamanyikwe ngani pakati pa batumiwa, sona bakaba babwandilo pakuba ba Kilisitu, bo nune ngali.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mundamukileko u Ambiliyato, umughaniwa wangu mwa Malafyale. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Mundamukileko sona nu Ulubano, umubombi umunyitu mumbombo ya Kilisitu, sona nu Sitaki, yo mughaniwa wangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Mundamukileko u Apele, yo mundu umusubiliwa ngani pambombo ya Kilisitu; mundamukileko aba munyumba ya Alisitobula. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Mundamukileko u Helodiyoni, umunyitu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Mundamukileko aba Kilisitu bosi aba munyumba iya Nalikisi, bo bandu ba malafyale.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Mundamukileko u Tilifena nu Tilifosa, abakolo bo bakwiyula ngani pambombo ya Malafyale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Mundamukileko umughaniwa wangu u Pelesi, umukolo yo iyula ngani pambombo ya Malafyale. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Miko15.21</ref>.</char></note> Mundamukileko u Lufu, umusubiliwa wa Malafyale, sona nu ng’ina, yo ali ngati we mayi wangu. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Mundamukileko u Asingilita, u Filegoni, u Helemesi, u Patiloba, u Helima, poka na bakamu bosi bo bali poka nabo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Mundamukileko u Filologa nu Juliya, sona mundamukileko u Neliya nu muyemba wake, sona nu Olimpa, poka na bandu abisa aba Chala bosi bo bali nabo.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Mulamunganaghe mwebene pakulangisya ulughano ulwenecho. Ifipanga fyosi ifya Kilisitu fikabalamuka.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulaghisya ukwabumalilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mwee bakamu bangu, ngubasuma ukuti muchebaghe na bandu bo bakugabannya, sona na bo bakubika ifipunulo musila sinyu pakumanyisya ifimanyisyo fyo filekanite na fyo mukamanyisiwa. Tilako kukwabo! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:19">Filp3.19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:4">Kols2.4</ref>.</char></note> Pakuti abandu bababa batakumubombela u Malafyale witu u Kilisitu, loli bakafibombela ifinyenwa fyabo. Sona na masyu ghabo ghabumyasi, sona ghabusimbuli bakubasimbula abandu bo batasimenye nachimo chimo. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Abandu bosi bifwile nisya kwifwila kwinyu, po une nahoboka ngani chifukwa cha mwemwe. Loli ngulonda ukuti mube bamahala pachindu cho chisa, sona nukuti mutakinong’onelagheko ni mbibi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Po u Chala umwenecho wa mutende akwisa pakumukanyangila pasi pa finama fyinyu. Ichisa cha Malafyale witu Yesu Kilisitu chibe numwe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />U Timoti, umubombi umunyitu, akubalamuka. U Lusiyasi, nu Yosoni, sona nu Sosipateli, aba Yuda abanyitu bope bakubalamuka.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Une ne Telitiyo, umusimbi bubu wa kalata uyu, ngubalamukila mwa Malafyale.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Imbo19.29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Kol1.14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Tim4.20</ref>.</char>
    </note>Wepa nu Gayi bubu, yo ambokelite une poka ni chipanga chosi munyumba yake, akubalamuka. U Elasita, umusungi wa ndalama isya kaya akakulu ngani, sona nu mukamu witu u Kwaliti bakubalamuka.<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amapalo ghabumalilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />U Chala aghindikiwaghe. Ali na maka pakubakasya mulwitiko lwinyu, ukuyana na Masyu Amisa agha Yesu Kilisitu gho nalumbilila, sona ukuyana nu bufumbuli ubwa findu ifyakubusyefu fyo fikafifiwa ukwanda kale. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Loli ipano fyafumbuliwa pabwelu ukwendela mu Ndaghilo sya Chala uwa bwile na bwile fyafumbuliwa ku bandu abaluko losi, umwakuti basubile nukwifwila.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kwa Chala mwene, yo wamahala, kube ubughindikiwa ubwa bwile na bwile ukwendela mwa Yesu Kilisitu! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>